    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ConfigurableTypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>ConfigurableTypeInformationMapper</code></a> for the given type map.",
      "translation": "为给定的类型映射创建一个新的<a href=\"ConfigurableTypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>ConfigurableTypeInformationMapper</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the alias to be used for the given <a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回用于给定<a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.core 中的接口\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>的别名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the actual <a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> to be used for the given alias.",
      "translation": "返回用于给定别名的实际<a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.core 中的接口\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
